      "project": "OPS",
      "summary": "Migrate the billing service database to the new Postgres cluster",
      "description": "The billing service still runs on the old Postgres 11 cluster, which goes out of vendor support on {{date:2027-03-31|%B %-d, %Y}}. Moving it needs the billing team, the DBA group, and the SRE on-call rotation. The work covers schema compatibility checks, setting up replication to the new cluster, a dual-write period, a cutover in a maintenance window, and decommissioning the old cluster afterwards. The design notes are on the \"Billing DB migration\" page in Confluence. This will run over several sprints.",
